<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left" align=left><o:wrapblock><v:line id=DocMarkLine style="Z-INDEX: 1; VISIBILITY: visible; POSITION: absolute; mso-position-vertical-relative: page" strokecolor="red" o:spid="_x0000_s1026" strokeweight="2pt" to="439.35pt,303.35pt" from="0,303.35pt"><w:wrap type="topAndBottom" anchory="page"><FONT size=5></FONT></w:wrap></v:line></o:wrapblock><BR style="mso-ignore: vglayout" clear=all><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></B></P><BR style="mso-ignore: vglayout" clear=all>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-no-proof: yes">绍兴市教育局关于公布<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年市属学校<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></H2>
<H2 style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: normal; TEXT-ALIGN: center" align=center><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体; mso-no-proof: yes">新教师招聘办法的通知<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></H2>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><A name=Body></A><A name=BodyEnd></A><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">为深入推进教育人事制度改革，优化师资队伍结构，不断提高教师队伍的整体素质，促进我市教育事业的可持续发展，根据国家和省、市有关文件精神，及市属学校<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年师资需求情况，现就<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年市属学校教师（职业高中专业课教师招聘办法另行公告）招聘办法公布如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">一、指导思想<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">坚持公开、平等、竞争、择优的原则，通过公开招考，拓宽吸引优秀人才从教的途径，进一步优化教师队伍结构，切实提高师资质量。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">二、招聘要求</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（一）政治思想表现好，热爱教育事业，热爱学生，品行端正，遵纪守法，身心健康。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（二）具备与招聘学科相一致的专业及学历要求（硕士研究生、国家“<SPAN lang=EN-US>211</SPAN>”工程大学毕业生允许按相近专业报考）。<U><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></U></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（三）具有教师的基本素质和教育教学能力，并取得相应教师资格证书（硕士研究生、国家</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=宋体>“</FONT></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">211</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=宋体>”</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">工程大学毕业生可在应聘后二年内取得）。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">三、招聘对象<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年绍兴市（所辖三市两县一区，下同）生源的师范类应届本科（除小教、学前教育专业）毕业生；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年绍兴市生源的列入国家</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=宋体>“</FONT></SPAN><?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /><st1:chmetcnv w:st="on" UnitName="”" SourceValue="211" HasSpace="False" Negative="False" NumberType="1" TCSC="0"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">211</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; mso-fareast-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-ascii-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT face=宋体>”</FONT></SPAN></st1:chmetcnv><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">工程的全日制大学应届本科毕业生；<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年浙江省生源的国家统招统考（包括教育部承认学历的国外高校）的全日制应届硕士研究生，年龄<SPAN lang=EN-US>28</SPAN>周岁以下（<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="1982" Month="1" Day="1" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>1982</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>以后出生）；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"> </SPAN>4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．<SPAN lang=EN-US>2009</SPAN>年参加过绍兴市教育局、越城区文教局师范类毕业生招聘考核，仍未就业的越城区户籍（<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>个街道、<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>个乡镇）生源的全日制师范类本科（除小教、学前教育专业）毕业生。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 黑体">四、招聘程序<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（一）公布需求计划<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoBodyTextIndent style="TEXT-JUSTIFY: inter-ideograph; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">绍兴市教育局在编制范围内审定核准招考计划，于<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="2" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>在绍兴教育网<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://www.sxsedu.net/"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体"><FONT color=#000000>www.sxsedu.net</FONT></SPAN></A></SPAN>公告。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（二）报名及资格确认<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．网上注册、报名<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="3" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>0:00--<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="8" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False">3<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>月8</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>日</SPAN></SPAN></st1:chsdate>24:00</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">网址：绍兴教育网<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://www.sxsedu.net/"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'"><FONT color=#000000>www.sxsedu.net</FONT></SPAN></A><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">报考人员上网注册个人信息后，选择报考学科（每名考生只能报考一门学科）。在报名期间报考人员可更改报考学科。<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="8" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>24:00</SPAN>停止网上注册、报名<SPAN lang=EN-US>,</SPAN>报考人员不能再更改报考学科。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．资格初审<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="9" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>0:00</SPAN>－<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="9" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>9</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>24:00</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">对报考人员进行资格初审。在此期间，报名系统不对报考人员开放。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．查询初审结果<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<SPAN lang=EN-US>20<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="10" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False">10<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>年3</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>月10</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>日</SPAN></SPAN></st1:chsdate>0:00</SPAN>—<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2009" Month="3" Day="12" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>12</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>12:00</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">注册报名人员登陆绍兴教育网查询资格初审结果。在此期间，对于已经注册报名但未能得到初审结果的考生，请致电<SPAN lang=EN-US>85221460</SPAN>，<SPAN lang=EN-US>85135974</SPAN>联系。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">4</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">．</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">现场资格确认及笔试报名、缴费<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">根据《全国普通高等学校毕业生就业协议》和有关证件证明进行现场确认。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">时间：<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="10" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>--<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="3" Day="14" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False">3<SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>月14</SPAN></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN lang=EN-US>日</SPAN></SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN lang=EN-US>（上午8:30</SPAN></SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>，下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>17:00</SPAN>。）<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">资格初审合格者</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">，在规定时间到绍兴市自考办（渔化桥河沿<SPAN lang=EN-US>56</SPAN>号）进行现场资格确认及笔试报名、缴费（每科<SPAN lang=EN-US>48</SPAN>元）。届时随带以下材料①下载打印的《绍兴市教育局<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年新教师招聘考核登记表》一式</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">两份</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">；②本人身份证、学生证、毕业证（历届生）、户口本（高考报名时户口所在地）等证件的原件、复印件和《全国普通高等学校毕业生就业协议书》原件。③其他相关证明材料。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'"> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">参加市属学校教师招聘考试的考生须经绍兴市教育局现场资格确认，并参加绍兴市教育局考点的相关考试，方能取得市属学校教师招聘录用资格。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">（三）考试<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">1</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">．笔试<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）测试科目<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">考生须参加对应学科专业知识（或专业技能测试）和中学教育基础知识两科的考试。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">①对应学科专业知识：政治、历史、地理、语文、英语、数学、物理、化学、生物、信息技术（以上科目高中、初中相同）；科学、社会（初中）；报考体育专业的参加绍兴市教育局组织的专业技能测试。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">②中学教育基础知识。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）考试形式、内容<U><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></U></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">参加浙江省教师基本素质测试。笔试内容、范围请登录浙江教育考试网（<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="http://www.zjzs.net/"><SPAN style="COLOR: windowtext; mso-bidi-font-size: 15.0pt; mso-ansi-font-size: 15.0pt">www.zjzs.net</SPAN></A></SPAN>）招生考试最新动态中的有关学科考试说明查询。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）分值设置<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">笔试占总成绩的<SPAN lang=EN-US>60%</SPAN>，其中学科专业知识考试（体育学科为专业技能测试）成绩占<SPAN lang=EN-US>45%</SPAN>，中学教育基础知识成绩占<SPAN lang=EN-US>15%</SPAN>。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>）笔试时间<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="4" Day="17" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2010</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">上午<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>11</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>中学教育基础知识；<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="4" Day="17" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2010</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">年<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>日</SPAN></st1:chsdate><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>00</SPAN>——<SPAN lang=EN-US>16</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>30<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN></SPAN>对应学科专业知识；<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="4" Day="17" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>4</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>17</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>下午<SPAN lang=EN-US>13:30</SPAN>－<SPAN lang=EN-US>17:30<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">   </SPAN></SPAN>体育专业技能测试。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">2</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Trebuchet MS'">．面试<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>）根据笔试成绩，从高分到低分按学科需求数的<SPAN lang=EN-US>1:3</SPAN>划定面试入围人员，届时在绍兴教育网公布面试入围人员名单及成绩。</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312; mso-hansi-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>）面试为课堂教学能力考核，着重考察教师专业素质及综合素质。面试占总成绩的<SPAN lang=EN-US>40%</SPAN>；<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">（<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>）面试具体时间、地点，届时在绍兴教育网另行公告。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（四）附加分<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">根据毕业生提供材料审核、确定，总加分累计不超过<SPAN lang=EN-US>3</SPAN>分。计分办法为：硕士研究生、低保户子女（有民政部门提供证件）加<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN>分；在校期间一次（按学年度计，两学期按一学年计，下同）获得校级一等及以上奖学金者加<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>分，一次获得校级二等奖学金者加<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.5</SPAN>分，一次获得校级三等奖学金者加<SPAN lang=EN-US>0.3</SPAN>分。附加分确定前实行公示。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（五）录取<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．按应聘者报考志愿录用。根据总成绩加附加分，从高分到低分择优确定并在绍兴教育网上公布各学科成绩及按招聘计划<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>：<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN>参加体检人员名单。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．体检。按《浙江省教师资格认定体检标准》执行，由教育局统一组织实行，体检不合格，取消录用资格，缺额不再增补。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3.</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">公布拟录用人员名单。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">4</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．组织现场公开录用。由绍兴市教育局统一组织。拟录用人员按总成绩（含附加分）从高到低排序（成绩并列时，则面试成绩高者排先），由拟录用人员按顺序依次自主选择学校。现场录用时，因拟录用人员自动放弃岗位选择，该学科出现的缺额，不再增补。<SPAN lang=EN-US> <o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（六）试用<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">聘用单位与录用人员于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>15</SPAN>日前签订《全国普通高等学校毕业生就业协议书》（若违约按规定缴纳违约金）。<st1:chsdate w:st="on" Year="2010" Month="8" Day="10" IsLunarDate="False" IsROCDate="False"><SPAN lang=EN-US>2010</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>8</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>10</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>持毕业证书、学位证书、教师资格证书、报到证向绍兴市教育局政治处报到，逾期不报到视作自动放弃。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">新招聘教师全部实行人事代理。第一年为见习期，由用人单位与毕业生本人签订一年见习协议，见习期满，经考核合格办理聘用手续，签订聘用协议；考核不合格，取消聘用资格。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 楷体_GB2312">（七）其他规定<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．凡大学期间受过党纪校纪处分的，报到时因个人原因没拿到毕业证书、教师资格等证书的，录用人员的学籍档案审核后发现提供的相关证件、材料有弄虚作假行为等，不予录用；已经录用的即取消录用资格，缺额不再增补。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly" align=left><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">2.2010</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">届越城区户籍（<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>街道、<SPAN lang=EN-US>7</SPAN>乡镇）生源的师范类毕业生应聘未录用并未就业的，允许参加<SPAN lang=EN-US>2011</SPAN>年绍兴市教育局公开招考，已经被录用而未报到的不得参加次年招考。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 30pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 15pt; COLOR: black; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312">．绍兴市教育局将加强监督，成立教师招聘工作监督小组，进行全程监督，对违反招考纪律的单位和个人，按有关规定严肃处理。为接受社会群众监督，教育局设立监督电话：<SPAN lang=EN-US>85200216<SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>85134362<o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoDate style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly"><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=仿宋_GB2312 size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
